Colour schemes converted from https://github.com/mbadolato/iTerm2-Color-Schemes at commit 3d8a6a1a983d7fe721aa6cb9a5b98066cd74303a (MIT licence, see LICENSE). Regenerate with `cargo run -p terminus-themes -- <scheme folder>`. Terminus Dark and Terminus Light are written by the Terminus authors; Unluminous Dark, Unluminous Light, Islands Dracula Colorful, Material Palenight, Material Deep Ocean and One Dark are the themes Unluminous ships, and chrome.txt holds their tab bar colours.
